      "text": "@USCG has announced its first expenditure of funds under the One Big Beautiful Bill Act to upgrade moorings at Base Charleston. This project will form a homeport cornerstone of the Coast Guard’s major cutter fleet, enhancing our ability to establish U.S. maritime dominance and defend U.S. borders and maritime approaches. Under the leadership of @POTUS and @Sec_Noem, the Coast Guard continues its renewal through a nearly $25B investment and Force Design 2028.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/4qCMVSlJ6M\n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
