      "text": "The Coast Guard is innovating for the future. On Sept. 2, 2025, we established the Futures Development and Integration (FD&I) directorate to drive our transformation to a more agile, capable, and responsive force through Force Design 2028. FD&I unites strategy, wargaming, innovation, and R&D to close capability gaps, prioritize resources, and harness emerging tech. \n \nWatch the video to learn more about this bold step forward. \n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028",
