      "text": "Leading America's drug interdictions, owning the sea!\n \nSince launching Operation Pacific Viper, @USCG has interdicted 40K+ pounds of cocaine and apprehended 36 suspected smugglers. Alongside partners and allies, our maritime fighting force is surging to the Eastern Pacific, disrupting cartels, and keeping illicit drugs out of American communities. We are bringing every capability to bear to secure U.S. borders and maritime approaches.\n \nThis is where defense of America begins.\n \nRead more about our Eastern Pacific operations here: https://t.co/UPiRjUVEjr\n\n#USCG #TipoftheSpear #druginterdiction #EveryWarEveryShore #WeOwnTheSea @DHSgov @USCGLANTAREA  @USCGPACAREA @Southcom @jiatfs",
