      "text": "🚨 Immigration Enforcement\n\nThis week, Coast Guard crews interdicted 30+ aliens off California & USCGC Spencer repatriated 191 Haitians.\n\nThe Coast Guard remains vigilant across the Nation’s 31,000 miles of maritime borders. Continuing our immigration enforcement mission, we are surging assets to protect America’s territorial integrity and sovereignty.\n\n#USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #WeOwnTheSea\n@DHSgov @USCGNorCal @USCGSoutheast @USCGPACAREA @USCGLANTAREA",
